      "body": "\r\n\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n`benchmark_moe`’s fallback (`else`) assumed Mixtral-style fields (`num_local_experts` / `num_experts_per_tok` / `intermediate_size` after `get_text_config()`). Many MoE HF configs use other names (`num_experts`, `n_routed_experts`, …), nested views, or list-valued fields, so shape resolution failed and the bench could not run.\r\n\r\nThis PR replaces that Mixtral-only fallback with a small generic HF MoE extractor (nested views + field aliases). Existing architecture-specific `elif` branches are unchanged.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n```bash\r\n# resolve shape only (no weights)\r\npython benchmarks/kernels/benchmark_moe.py --model <hf-id> --tp-size 1 --batch-size 1\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n| Model | Before PR | This PR | Shape `(E, topk, inter, hidden)` |\r\n|-------|-----------|---------|----------------------------------|\r\n| mistralai/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1 | ✅ | ✅ | `(8, 2, 14336, 4096)` |\r\n| unsloth/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct | ✅ | ✅ | `(16, 1, 8192, 5120)` |\r\n| openai/gpt-oss-20b | ✅ | ✅ | `(32, 4, 2880, 2880)` |\r\n| tencent/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct | ❌ | ✅ | `(64, 8, 3072, 4096)` |\r\n| tencent/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil | ❌ | ✅ | `(64, 8, 3072, 4096)` |\r\n| meituan-longcat/LongCat-Flash-Chat | ❌ | ✅ | `(512, 12, 12288, 6144)` |\r\n| inclusionAI/Ling-lite | ❌ | ✅ | `(64, 6, 1408, 2048)` |\r\n| inclusionAI/Ling-mini-2.0 | ❌ | ✅ | `(256, 8, 512, 2048)` |\r\n| openbmb/MiniCPM-MoE-8x2B | ❌ | ✅ | `(8, 2, 5760, 2304)` |\r\n---\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [ ] The purpose of the PR, such as \"Fix some issue (link existing issues this PR will resolve)\".\r\n- [ ] The test plan, such as providing test command.\r\n- [ ] The test results, such as pasting the results comparison before and after, or e2e results\r\n- [ ] (Optional) The necessary documentation update, such as updating `supported_models.md` and `examples` for a new model.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n",
